OL,3,AAt least 64 killed in Spanish
OL,4,Ahigh-speed train crash with dozens
OL,5,Aseriously injured, regional government
OL,6,Asays
OL,7,
OL,8,FAt least 64 people have been killed
OL,9,Fafter a Spanish high-speed train
OL,10,Fcollided with another train south of
OL,11,Fthe capital Madrid
OL,13,FThe updated death toll makes the rail
OL,14,Fdisaster the country's worst since 2013
OL,16,FSpain's transport minister says an
OL,17,F"inexplicable" decision by the control
OL,18,Fcentre led to the collision after a
OL,19,Fcomputer failure initially caused
OL,20,Ftrains to halt
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
